# Offline-model evaluation workspace.
# The tooling (*.py / *.sh / *.md / models.txt / colab_eval.ipynb) IS committed.
# Model weights, run outputs, logs, and caches stay local. Result JSONs are
# ignored by default but a curated set is force-added (git add -f) so the
# leaderboard is reproducible — see FINDINGS_offline_model_eval.md.
ollama_models/
results/
results2/
results2_md/
runs/
*.log
*.jsonl
__pycache__/
# results2/ holds the improved (per-family-tuned) board; its JSONs are
# force-added (git add -f) like results/. results2_md/ + cloud_models_md.txt are
# the Markdown-vs-XML experiment scratch — local only.
cloud_models_md.txt
